          "_name": "features5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features5\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"3\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showsubTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#fafafa\" condition=\"showLink\" selected>\n\n        <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"columns\">\n            <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n            <option value=\"4\">3</option>\n            <option value=\"6\" selected>2</option>\n            <option value=\"12\">1</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/untitled-design-3.png\" selected parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                                    <b>TỪ KHI DÙNG</b><br><b class=\"linkedin-font\">LINKEDIN</b>\n                                </h5>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text-mdf mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text .mbr-section-btn\"><i>Gói đăng tuyển không giới hạn giúp doanh nghiệp <b>dễ dàng chủ động</b> trong việc tìm kiếm và tiếp cận ứng viên tiềm năng</i></p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                  <ul class=\"gp2\">\n                                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-3 gap-3 lh-sm\">\n                                      <span class=\"check\">\n                                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"check_svg\">\n                                          <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.416 3.376a.75.75 0 0 1 .208 1.04l-5 7.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.154.114l-3-3a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l2.353 2.353 4.493-6.74a.75.75 0 0 1 1.04-.207Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n                                        </svg>     \n                                      </span>Nguồn ứng viên dồi dào và đạt chất lượng cao, được cập nhật thường xuyên<br>\n                                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-3 gap-3 lh-sm\">\n                                      <span class=\"check\">\n                                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"check_svg\">\n                                          <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.416 3.376a.75.75 0 0 1 .208 1.04l-5 7.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.154.114l-3-3a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l2.353 2.353 4.493-6.74a.75.75 0 0 1 1.04-.207Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n                                        </svg>     \n                                      </span>Đẩy tin tự động miễn phí tới ứng viên phù hợp bằng AI, qua Email &amp; App<br>\n                                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-3 gap-3 lh-sm\">\n                                      <span class=\"check\">\n                                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"check_svg\">\n                                          <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.416 3.376a.75.75 0 0 1 .208 1.04l-5 7.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.154.114l-3-3a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l2.353 2.353 4.493-6.74a.75.75 0 0 1 1.04-.207Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n                                        </svg>     \n                                      </span>Chủ động trong việc đăng tuyển và chỉnh sửa tin không giới hạn, nhanh chóng\n                                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-3 gap-3 lh-sm\">\n                                      <span class=\"check\">\n                                        <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"check_svg\">\n                                          <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M12.416 3.376a.75.75 0 0 1 .208 1.04l-5 7.5a.75.75 0 0 1-1.154.114l-3-3a.75.75 0 0 1 1.06-1.06l2.353 2.353 4.493-6.74a.75.75 0 0 1 1.04-.207Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n                                        </svg>     \n                                      </span>Cam kết không phát sinh bất kỳ chi phí nào khác<br>\n                                    </li>\n                                  </ul>\n                                </div> \n\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image mb-4 col-12 col-md-{{columns}}\">\n                <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-12\">\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <h5 class=\"card-title-2 mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                                    <b>TRƯỚC KHI DÙNG</b><br><b class=\"linkedin-font\"> LINKEDIN</b></h5>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text-mdf mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><i>Nền tảng tuyển dụng truyền thống <b>gặp nhiều hạn chế</b> trong việc tìm kiếm &amp; tiếp cận ứng viên tiềm năng</i></p>\n                                <div class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                                  <ul class=\"gp2\">\n                                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-3 gap-3 lh-sm\">\n                                      <span class=\"gross\">\n  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"gross_svg\">\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M18.364 5.636a1 1 0 010 1.414L7.414 18.364a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L17.586 5.636a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.636 5.636a1 1 0 011.414 0L18.364 16.95a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L5.636 7.05a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n  </svg>\n</span>Nguồn ứng viên hạn chế, ít kinh nghiệm, không được cập nhật thường xuyên<br>\n                                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-3 gap-3 lh-sm\">\n                                      <span class=\"gross\">\n  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"gross_svg\">\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M18.364 5.636a1 1 0 010 1.414L7.414 18.364a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L17.586 5.636a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.636 5.636a1 1 0 011.414 0L18.364 16.95a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L5.636 7.05a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n  </svg>\n</span>Đẩy tin tự động đến ứng viên bằng cách thủ công, mất phí khi đẩy tin tự động<br>\n                                    </li>\n                                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-3 gap-3 lh-sm\">\n                                      <span class=\"gross\">\n  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"gross_svg\">\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M18.364 5.636a1 1 0 010 1.414L7.414 18.364a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L17.586 5.636a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.636 5.636a1 1 0 011.414 0L18.364 16.95a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L5.636 7.05a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n  </svg>\n</span>Đăng tuyển và tùy chỉnh có giới hạn, mất thời gian chờ để được xét duyệt từ hệ thống</li>\n                                    <li class=\"d-flex align-items-center mb-3 gap-3 lh-sm\">\n                                      <span class=\"gross\">\n  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" class=\"gross_svg\">\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M18.364 5.636a1 1 0 010 1.414L7.414 18.364a1 1 0 01-1.414-1.414L17.586 5.636a1 1 0 011.414 0z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n    <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M5.636 5.636a1 1 0 011.414 0L18.364 16.95a1 1 0 01-1.414 1.414L5.636 7.05a1 1 0 010-1.414z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path>\n  </svg>\n</span>Có thể phát sinh nhiều chi phí dịch vụ bán kèm khác<br>\n                                    </li>\n                                  </ul>\n                                </div> \n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn d-flex justify-content-center\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-danger\" href=\"index.html#formlead\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Đăng ký ngay</a></div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
